window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They saved me…only to sacrifice me…</b></p> <p><b>To him.</b></p> <p><i>They call it the Rapture, when the vampire king comes.</i></p> <p>And this time, he’s come for me.</p> <p>Just as he’s come every 10 years for so long, no one can even remember when it all began.</p> <p>He’s the villain in my story; I see that right away.</p> <p>But when his teeth sink into my skin…something happens.</p> <p>Something that isn’t supposed to.</p> <p>Instead of draining me like all the others…</p> <p>He changes me.</p> <p>Makes me like him.</p> <p>Now I’m trapped in his kingdom of monsters.</p> <p>Completely unrecognizable from the girl I once was.</p> <p><b><i>He and his lost boys have changed the rules of the game.</i></b></p> <p><b><i>But the more time that passes, the more I realize…I still want to play.</i></b></p> <p><i>Rapture </i>is a stand-alone reverse harem novel that can be listened to independently from the rest of the shared world. <i>Rapture </i>is a dark, reverse harem reimagining of Peter Pan with morally grey love interests and paranormal MC vibes. This is a complete stand-alone set in the MC Syndicates shared world and is intended for mature audiences.</p> <p>MC Syndicates is a shared universe, crafted by a set of <i>USA Today</i> and international best-selling authors, that features an array of paranormal species, savage, dominant men, and strong heroines. These stories are all set in the same world and can be listened to in any order.</p>"; 
